{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Enable JSON INFO logging for the replay canaries**\n\nThis case relies on `context.logger.info(...)`, while the conformance runner scopes CloudWatch records using the logger's `executionArn` field. With Lambda's default logging configuration, these INFO records can be suppressed and the structured field does not survive text formatting, so requirement 11-1 cannot verify replay or the absence of step-body execution. Add the JSON/INFO logging configuration already used by the step and child suites.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7o_aov","finding_digest":"e0901a59045895a3bef3d3e630d3eba381a574fe189cf4eb1da6aaa7a0e1762e","finding_id":"arf_v1_4cibuwielck2hpxt2ptdbu7luo","finding_key":"conformance/template_general.yaml::replay_operation_identity::execution-scoped-info-logging","identity_key":"conformance/template_general.yaml::replay_operation_identity::execution-scoped-info-logging","line":7,"observation_digest":"1eba9e3b782340b8503fb7229a30ca6048e97b470d57bbf25a39b6f4a179f3d0","observation_id":"aro_v1_d25j4o3yenalqub7w4rjumgkmb","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests/template_general.yaml","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T22:21:14Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6qx34szy3l7wsisqtrhrt7xdjv","reviewed_base_sha":"0325f6a0083ed9c0d80aaa38279aa9311b77c0e2","reviewed_head_sha":"561f380cb25380b74313306ced2a9b656b6c7262","reviewer":"codex","start_line":7,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_leonctkwckcnnnuhnsp5wtwgmp"},"pull_request":{"number":701},"record_id":"art_v1_gxo46zdxlufvh47uvob3taefnk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T22:21:14Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
